  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space into the ultimate sports sanctuary with the Custom Vintage Galaxy Football Comforter by Jeminise. This custom-made bedding set is designed specifically for football lovers, players, and fans who want to bring the excitement of the game into their room decor. Featuring a stunning vintage galaxy football theme, this comforter offers a perfect blend of style, lightweight warmth, and personalized comfort.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features customizable text inputs allowing you to personalize the bedding with your chosen name and number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with a soft, whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sporty Visual Theme:</strong> Decorated with a vibrant digital graphic illustration of an American football on a cosmic nebula and star background.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Bedding Sizes:</strong> Designed to fit various bed setups including US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> The package comes with 1 Comforter (or Duvet Cover) and optional matching pillowcases depending on your selection.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry on low heat for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Vintage Galaxy Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
